  "_readme": "SOURCE OF TRUTH for the park/hold/veto label vocabulary (ga-r150x9). To add or remove a label: edit a group's \"members\" list here, then run `python3 scripts/generate_park_labels.py --write` to regenerate park_labels.py and park_labels.sh, and commit all three files together. Do NOT hand-edit park_labels.py or park_labels.sh directly -- `generate_park_labels.py --check` (see scripts/test_generate_park_labels.py) fails loudly if they drift from what this file generates. This file is itself a valid jq-consumable fragment: `jq '.groups[].members[].label' scripts/park_labels.json` lists every vocabulary label; `jq '.groups[] | select(.in_park_labels) | .members[].label'` lists just the PARK_LABELS union.",
